# The browser app no longer needs a key: YouTube search runs in the Vercel
# Function api/search.ts. Set YOUTUBE_API_KEY (or VITE_YOUTUBE_API_KEY) in the
# Vercel project's Environment Variables instead.
#
# Optional: point the app at a different search endpoint (e.g. another deployment).
# VITE_SEARCH_API=https://your-project.vercel.app/api/search
